Wishing for SDSM and the +oMM was a bit wasteful.  As a wizard, you
should wish for an uncursed magic marker.
If you have some blank scrolls and a useless spellbook, the magic
marker can write a cursed scroll of genocide (silver dragons), a
blessed scroll of charging, the spellbook of Magic Mapping, plus other
useful spells you seem to have missed (jumping, for example), scrolls
of enchant armor, etc.  You should also have done a little altar
camping with create monster after you finished the quest in order to
get the spellbook of Finger of Death.

